    <div class="case spot reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="tag tag--on-dark">The context</span>
        <h3>Financial reporting built by hand, cycle after cycle</h3>
        <p>The Foundation's reporting office regularly produces financial reports that combine data from different databases and sources. Each time, the work started from scratch: extract the data, paste it into a consolidation file, check it and rebuild tables and charts.</p>
        <p>A slow, repetitive and fragile process: a single shifted column in an export was enough to introduce an error that was hard to spot.</p>
        <span class="tag tag--on-dark">The goal</span>
        <p>Automate two reporting processes without introducing new software, leaving the team with a tool they can use and maintain on their own.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="facts">
