<div><dt>Duration</dt><dd>2 half-days</dd></div>
<div><dt>Technology</dt><dd>Excel, Power Query, Power Pivot</dd></div>
<div><dt>Automated processes</dt><dd>2: data consolidation and dashboards</dd></div>
<div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Used independently by the team</dd></div>
  </dl>
</div>
